From f31af82f74921fd7f5fa92cbef537487294529f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 17:56:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] Adapt the keyboard to tablets

On screens 600dp wide and more (or when forced in the theme settings) the keyboard
is limited to a maximum width (default 900dp) and centered, the keys area is kept
between 240dp and 340dp high, and key labels, the candidate bar and key popups are
scaled up by 1.2.
